Zine — a Yapfast theme

1. The theme itself — theme.json, the pictures in art/ and previews/, and the
   sounds in sounds/ — is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
   https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
   Every texture, halftone, tape strip and stamp in art/ was generated from noise
   by a script written for this theme; every sound in sounds/ was synthesised
   from noise and sine partials by a script written for this theme. No outside
   images or recordings are used.

2. The icons in icons/ are Yapfast's stock icons re-inked for this theme (each
   shape rasterised, thickened, given a hand wobble and traced back to a path).
   They are adaptations, so they keep their sources' licences:
   - Most come from Solar by 480 Design, under CC BY 4.0
     (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), via Iconify, as listed in
     Yapfast's ui/icons/README.md. Changes: re-drawn in a hand-inked style.
   - calendar, check, chevron-down, chevron-left, chevron-right, hand, maximize,
     minimize, minus, restore, slash, square, x, forward and reply come from
     Lucide (https://lucide.dev/), under the ISC licence:
       ISC License. Copyright (c) for portions of Lucide are held by Cole Bemis
       2013-2022 as part of Feather (MIT). All other copyright (c) for Lucide
       are held by Lucide Contributors 2022.
       Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any
       purpose with or without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above
       copyright notice and this permission notice appear in all copies.
       THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND THE AUTHOR DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES.
   - The icons drawn for Yapfast itself (see its ui/icons/README.md) and logo.svg
     are re-inked here under the same terms as Yapfast's own.
   Discord's logo and the verified badge are not replaced; they stay stock.

3. The fonts in fonts/ are each under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
   (https://openfontlicense.org); full texts sit beside them. They are not sold
   on their own.
   - CourierPrime-Regular.ttf, CourierPrime-Bold.ttf — Courier Prime,
     Copyright 2015 The Courier Prime Project Authors. fonts/OFL-courierprime.txt
   - Fraunces-Zine.ttf — Fraunces, Copyright 2018 The Fraunces Project Authors.
     Modified: an instance of Fraunces[SOFT,WONK,opsz,wght].ttf pinned at opsz 36,
     SOFT 0, WONK 1 (weight axis kept). No Reserved Font Name. fonts/OFL-fraunces.txt
   - ArchivoBlack-Regular.ttf — Archivo Black, Copyright 2017 The Archivo Black
     Project Authors. fonts/OFL-archivoblack.txt
   - Staatliches-Regular.ttf — Staatliches, Copyright 2018 The Staatliches
     Authors. fonts/OFL-staatliches.txt
   - Anton-Regular.ttf — Anton, Copyright 2020 The Anton Project Authors.
     fonts/OFL-anton.txt
   - AbrilFatface-Regular.ttf — Abril Fatface, Copyright (c) 2011 TypeTogether.
     fonts/OFL-abrilfatface.txt
   - Bungee-Regular.ttf — Bungee, Copyright 2023 The Bungee Project Authors.
     fonts/OFL-bungee.txt
   - DMSerifDisplay-Regular.ttf — DM Serif Display, Copyright 2014-2018 Adobe,
     with Reserved Font Name 'Source'; Copyright 2019 Google LLC.
     fonts/OFL-dmserifdisplay.txt
   - RubikMonoOne-Regular.ttf — Rubik Mono One, Copyright 2015 The Rubik Project
     Authors. fonts/OFL-rubikmonoone.txt
   - RammettoOne-Regular.ttf — Rammetto One, Copyright 2011 The Rammetto Project
     Authors, with Reserved Font Name Rammetto. fonts/OFL-rammettoone.txt
   All fonts are shipped unmodified except Fraunces as noted.
